                                                "sense_id": "31b825ab-6aa9-36d7-9cf7-98d58bb60651",
                                                "text": "I may have snuck in showering myself—plus shaving, loofahing, hair blow-drying, reapplying makeup, changing my outfit five times, and winding up in what I started out with."
